      "summary": "🧠 Train a 64M-parameter LLM from scratch in just 2h!https://jingyaogong.github.io/minimind \n  \n \n \n       \n \n \n  \n \n \n \"大道至简\" \n \n \n 中文 | English \n \n \n 此开源项目旨在完全从 0 开始，仅用 3 块钱成本与 2 小时训练时间，即可训练出规模约为 64M 的超小语言模型 MiniMind。 \n MiniMind 系列极其轻量，主线最小版本体积约为 GPT-3 的 $\\frac{1}{2700}$，力求让普通个人 GPU 也能快速完成训练与复现。 \n 项目同时开源了大模型的极简结构与完整训练链路，覆盖 MoE、数据清洗、预训练（Pretrain）、监督微调（SFT）、LoRA、RLHF（DPO）、RLAIF（PPO / GRPO / CISPO）、Tool Use、Agentic RL、自适应思考与模型蒸馏等全过程代码。 \n MiniMind 同时拓展了视觉模态模型 MiniMind-V、多模态 Omni 模型 MiniMind-O、扩散语言模",
      "category": "科技",
      "published_at": "",
      "why_relevant": "64M参数小模型，极低成本训练",
      "relevance_score": 9.0
    },
    {
      "version": 1,
      "id_scheme_version": 1,
      "article_id": "a1_01a6a40f7985fbc9a4c13cb3",
      "headline": "Claude Fable 5.1 made me a really nice animated pelican",
      "confirmed_facts": [
        {
          "fact_id": "f1",
          "text": "Claude Fable 5.1 made me a really nice animated pelican 1st September 2026 Today is Claude Fable (and Mythos) 5.1 day.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-02T08:06:19.348698+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "44035499b342f7f258243369b278cdcbc447f505e619d9502b6f47a2009e464b",
          "excerpt": "Claude Fable 5.1 made me a really nice animated pelican 1st September 2026 Today is Claude Fable (and Mythos) 5.1 day.",
          "sentence_hash": "757b49cce362e214c135f28c1c13a62c60e84a2646bb210001bb9bba21e7bc56",
          "anchors": [
            "September 20",
            "really"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f2",
          "text": "Anthropic say that Fable 5.1 “sets a new standard for coding, knowledge work, and long-running problem-solving tasks”.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-02T08:06:19.348733+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "44035499b342f7f258243369b278cdcbc447f505e619d9502b6f47a2009e464b",
          "excerpt": "Anthropic say that Fable 5.1 “sets a new standard for coding, knowledge work, and long-running problem-solving tasks”.",
          "sentence_hash": "b62af94c80e3307fa5ae6251b0d45def251cd779d5d1895f6288664288f4dd1d",
          "anchors": [
            "sol"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f3",
          "text": "Their announcement spends a notable amount of time on scientific research, boasting of a 52.6% score on the brand new Terminal-Bench-Science 0.1 benchmark (first announced on August 27th), up from 24.7% for Fable 5, 29.0% for Opus 5 and 22.4% for GPT-5.6 Sol.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-02T08:06:19.348776+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "44035499b342f7f258243369b278cdcbc447f505e619d9502b6f47a2009e464b",
          "excerpt": "Their announcement spends a notable amount of time on scientific research, boasting of a 52.6% score on the brand new Terminal-Bench-Science 0.1 benchmark (first announced on August 27th), up from 24.7% for Fable 5, 29.0% for Opus 5 and 22.4% for GPT-5.6 Sol.",
          "sentence_hash": "ecddd7a3e68c3d160fc13eb3839caabd48ffb1855144149ae5d2d7c51474bcc1",
          "anchors": [
            "52.6%",
            "24.7%",
            "29.0%",
            "bench",
            "August 27",
            "22.4%"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f4",
          "text": "Other benchmarks show slightly improved scores, but none as impressive as the Science one.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-02T08:06:19.348798+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "44035499b342f7f258243369b278cdcbc447f505e619d9502b6f47a2009e464b",
          "excerpt": "Other benchmarks show slightly improved scores, but none as impressive as the Science one.",
          "sentence_hash": "bdeff4585f0a3de476914b2b0d84476ed7644e0e20f13f207594606def5551c7",
          "anchors": [
            "but",
            "bench"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f5",
          "text": "Back in July I wrote about how I was losing faith in the pelican benchmark—its connection to how good the models were at other tasks didn’t seem to hold as strongly as it did back in 2025.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-09-02T08:06:19.348838+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "44035499b342f7f258243369b278cdcbc447f505e619d9502b6f47a2009e464b",
          "excerpt": "Back in July I wrote about how I was losing faith in the pelican benchmark—its connection to how good the models were at other tasks didn’t seem to hold as strongly as it did back in 2025.",
          "sentence_hash": "84ad8d4a510024235bfddc52958415ed7026a6ef4178883656193107ca9846e9",
          "anchors": [
            "back",
            "other",
            "bench"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f6",
          "text": "Fable 5.1 has five reasoning levels: low, medium, high, xhigh, max—and no option to turn off reasoning entirely.",
