      },
      "summary": "Today is Claude Fable (and Mythos) 5.1 day. Anthropic say that Fable 5.1 \"sets a new standard for coding, knowledge work, and long-running problem-solving tasks\". Their announcement spends a notable amount of time on scientific research, boasting of a 52.6% score on the brand new Terminal-Bench-Science 0.1 benchmark (first announced on August 27th), up from 24.7% for Fable 5, 29.0% for Opus 5 and 22.4% for GPT-5.6 Sol. Other benchmarks show slightly improved scores, but none as impressive as the",
